<title>CANADA: TecSyn to continue issuer bid program.</title>
<headline>TecSyn to continue issuer bid program.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>TecSyn International Inc said on Tuesday it received regulatory approval for the renewal of its normal course issuer bid initiated in October 1995.</p>
<p>The new bid will begin on November 29, 1996 and expire on November 28, 1997.</p>
<p>TecSyn plans to acquire up to 2.65 million shares or five percent of its 53.05 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>The company said its management was continuing the bid because it believed TecSyn shares were undervalued.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
